{"title":"Flameslate","slug":"Flameslate","pageid":2465,"revid":15469,"timestamp":"2024-10-25T20:40:01Z","lastEditor":"Eitanjuega","categories":["Stone","Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Stone","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay Island"},{"label":"Stone","value":"$75/stud"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$108/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$126/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v.1.52.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"appearance","text":"Appearance"},{"id":"textures","text":"Textures"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Flameslate</b> can be discovered deep within the depths of the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Magma_Caves/\">Magma Caves</a>, nestled upon small islands surrounded by <b>molten lava</b>.\n</p><p>As of the 1.67.0 update, <b>Flameslate</b> can spawn <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Magmite/\">Magmite</a> in their rocks.\n</p><p><b>Note:</b> Exercise caution when attempting to get <b>Flameslate</b>, as the intense heat will scorch you as you travel the bridges and planks connecting the islands. Always ensure you have a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Healing_Coil/\">Healing Coil</a> or <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fusion_Coil/\">Fusion Coil</a> ready to mitigate the effects of the heat.\n</p><p>The respawn time of Flameslate is unknown, although it does respawn in some servers, it is found that it frequently respawns every 5-10 minutes. Its recommended to farm Flameslate on solo Servers because leaving and rejoining will respawn the ores but you will have to blow up the rocks again.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"appearance\">Appearance</h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Flameslate Location-Appearance\">Flameslate Location-Appearance</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Flameslate Location-Appearance\">Flameslate Location-Appearance</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><b>Flameslate</b> shares the same stone, refined and forged textures as <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fungoidite/\">Fungoidite</a>, but with a distinctive twist. Its textures emulate molten lava, and the raw stone appears to be ablaze.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"textures\">Textures</h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"ba1e78827fa98b9ac8e4673bace18f4f\" data-seq-no=\"1\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Flameslatetexture-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Raw\">Raw</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Raw\">Raw</span></span></div></div><div>Raw</div></div><div><div><div id=\"Refinedflameslatetexture-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Refined\">Refined</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Refined\">Refined</span></span></div></div><div>Refined</div></div><div><div><div id=\"Forgedflameslatetexture-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Forged\">Forged</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Forged\">Forged</span></span></div></div><div>Forged</div></div></div>\n\n</div>"}
